# Example NiFi JVM bootstrap settings for vertical scaling.
# The stack uses NIFI_JVM_HEAP_INIT and NIFI_JVM_HEAP_MAX in docker-compose (env) by default.
# Mount this file (or merge these lines into your bootstrap.conf) if you run NiFi without compose.
#
# Heap (typical for 8–16GB host allocation for NiFi):
# java.arg.2=-Xms4g
# java.arg.3=-Xmx8g
#
# Optional: GC and metaspace
# java.arg.4=-XX:+UseG1GC
# java.arg.5=-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=512m
